    "dino.friends.sharingDisclosure" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional: publish this device’s best level results, measured times, stars and achievements to Game Center under your Apple display name. Apple may show them to other players, not only friends. Existing results are merged by taking the best result per level. When Show my score is off, only your level and boss achievements continue to update. Apple keeps previously published results and achievements; older game versions may still show scores. This parental gate is not legal consent. Your selected Dino colours are also shared with Game Center while connected."
          }
        },
        "en-AU" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional: publish this device’s best level results, measured times, stars and achievements to Game Center under your Apple display name. Apple may show them to other players, not only friends. Existing results are merged by taking the best result per level. When Show my score is off, only your level and boss achievements continue to update. Apple keeps previously published results and achievements; older game versions may still show scores. This parental gate is not legal consent. Your selected Dino colours are also shared with Game Center while connected."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اختياري: انشر أفضل نتائج المستويات والأوقات المسجّلة والنجوم والإنجازات من هذا الجهاز في Game Center تحت اسم العرض لدى Apple. قد تعرضها Apple للاعبين آخرين أيضًا. تُدمج النتائج بحفظ أفضل نتيجة لكل مستوى. إذا كان «إظهار نتيجتي» متوقفًا، يستمر تحديث مستواك وإنجازات الزعماء فقط. تحتفظ Apple بالنتائج والإنجازات المنشورة سابقًا، وقد تظل النتائج ظاهرة في الإصدارات الأقدم من اللعبة. شاشة التحقّق من ولي الأمر لا تُعدّ موافقة قانونية. تُشارك أيضًا ألوان دينو التي اخترتها مع Game Center ما دام متصلًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst die besten Levelergebnisse, gemessenen Spielzeiten, Sterne und Erfolge dieses Geräts unter deinem Apple-Anzeigenamen in Game Center veröffentlichen. Apple kann sie auch anderen Spielern anzeigen. Beim Zusammenführen bleibt das beste Ergebnis pro Level erhalten. Wenn „Meine Ergebnisse zeigen“ ausgeschaltet ist, werden nur noch die Erfolge für Level und Bosse aktualisiert. Apple behält veröffentlichte Ergebnisse und Erfolge. Ältere Spielversionen können Ergebnisse weiterhin anzeigen. Diese Abfrage für Erwachsene ersetzt keine rechtlich erforderliche Einwilligung. Solange Game Center verbunden ist, teilt das Spiel auch die Farben deines Dinos."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional: publish this device’s best level results, measured times, stars and achievements to Game Center under your Apple display name. Apple may show them to other players, not only friends. Existing results are merged by taking the best result per level. When Show my score is off, only your level and boss achievements continue to update. Apple keeps previously published results and achievements; older game versions may still show scores. This parental gate is not legal consent. Your selected Dino colors are also shared with Game Center while connected."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optioneel: publiceer de beste levelresultaten, gemeten tijden, sterren en prestaties van dit apparaat op Game Center onder je Apple-displaynaam. Apple kan ze ook aan andere spelers tonen, niet alleen aan vrienden. Bestaande resultaten worden samengevoegd met het beste resultaat per level. Als Toon mijn score uitstaat, blijven alleen je level en baasprestaties bijgewerkt. Apple bewaart eerder gepubliceerde resultaten en prestaties; oudere spelversies kunnen scores nog tonen. Dit ouderscherm is geen juridische toestemming. Je gekozen dinokleuren worden ook met Game Center gedeeld zolang je verbonden bent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
